```

Much better. And PlayerControls:

```java
var playControl = HStack.make(h -> h.alignment(VerticalAlignment.CENTER).spacing(18f))
        .children(c -> {
            c.add(Button.make(b -> b.action(this::prev)).modifiers(fontSize(20))
                    .children(Icon.make(IconName.SKIP_BACK)));
