`Button.children(Icon)` still varargs; a leaf. Fine. Could add block overload to Button too.

Nested:
```java
var trackInfo = HStack.make(h -> h.alignment(VerticalAlignment.CENTER).spacing(18f))
        .children(c -> {
            c.add(Image.make(computed(() -> current.get().cover()))
                    .modifiers(frame(f -> f.width(36).height(36)), scaledToFit()));
            c.add(VStack.make(v -> v.alignment(HorizontalAlignment.LEADING).spacing(2))
